msgstr "Östämä Caylawlar"

#: appearance.cpp:33
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Fonts</h1>On this page, you can configure which fonts Konqueror "
"should use to display the web pages you view."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror şriftları</h1>Bu bittä Konquerorweb säxifälären qaysı şrift belän "
"kürsätäçägen bilgelärgä bula."

#: appearance.cpp:43
msgid "Font Si&ze"
msgstr "Yazu &Bieklege"

#: appearance.cpp:46 appearance.cpp:62
msgid "This is the relative font size Konqueror uses to display web sites."
msgstr "Bu - Konqueror web-säxifälär kürsäter öçen qullanğan nisbätle şrift."

#: appearance.cpp:49
msgid "M&inimum font size:"
msgstr "M&inimal' şrift zurlığı:"

#: appearance.cpp:53
msgid ""
"Konqueror will never display text smaller than this size,"
"<br>overriding any other settings"
msgstr ""
"Başqa köylämälärgä qaramíça"
"<br>, Konqueror berqayçan da bu zurlıqtan keçeräk tekstnı kürsätmäs"

#: appearance.cpp:57
msgid "&Medium font size:"
msgstr "&Urtaça şrift zurlığı:"

#: appearance.cpp:67
msgid "S&tandard font:"
msgstr "S&tandart şrift:"

#: appearance.cpp:75
msgid "This is the font used to display normal text in a web page."
msgstr "Web-säxifädä töp yazmalar kürsätü öçen qullanılğan yazu."

#: appearance.cpp:88
msgid "&Fixed font:"
msgstr "Üzgärmäs şri&ft:"

#: appearance.cpp:96
msgid ""
"This is the font used to display fixed-width (i.e. non-proportional) text."
msgstr ""
"Bu kiñlege üzgärmägän (mäs. nisbätle bulmağan) şrift kürsätü öçen qullanıla."

#: appearance.cpp:109
msgid "S&erif font:"
msgstr "S&erif şriftı:"

#: appearance.cpp:117
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as serif."
msgstr "Bu şrift serif itep tamğalanğan tekst kürsätü öçen qullanıla."

#: appearance.cpp:130
msgid "Sa&ns serif font:"
msgstr "Sa&ns serif şriftı:"

#: appearance.cpp:138
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as sans-serif."
msgstr "Bu şrift sans-serif itep tamğalanğan tekst kürsätü öçen qullanıla."

#: appearance.cpp:152
msgid "C&ursive font:"
msgstr "K&ursif şriftı:"

#: appearance.cpp:160
msgid "This is the font used to display text that is marked up as italic."
msgstr "Bu kursuf itep tamğalanğan tekst kürsätü öçen qullanıla."

#: appearance.cpp:174
msgid "Fantas&y font:"
msgstr "Fantas&y şriftı:"

#: appearance.cpp:182
msgid ""
"This is the font used to display text that is marked up as a fantasy font."
msgstr "Bu fantasy itep tamğalanğan tekst kürsätü öçen qullanıla."

#: appearance.cpp:196
msgid "Font &size adjustment for this encoding:"
msgstr "Bu kodlama öçen şrift &zurlığın köyläw:"

#: appearance.cpp:208
msgid "Default encoding:"
msgstr "Ğädäti bilgelämä:"

#: appearance.cpp:216 appearance.cpp:405
msgid "Use Language Encoding"
msgstr "Tel Kodlamasın faydalan"

#: appearance.cpp:220
msgid ""
"Select the default encoding to be used; normally, you will be fine with 'Use "
"language encoding' and should not have to change this."
msgstr ""
"Qullanılaçaq bar bulğan kodlamanı sayla; ğädättä 'Tel Kodlamasın faydalan' "
"belän härnärsä äybät eşli häm monı üzgärtüdä íxtíac yuq."

#: domainlistview.cpp:47
msgid "Host/Domain"
msgstr "Xuca/Domen"

#: domainlistview.cpp:48
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Tärti&p"

#: domainlistview.cpp:55
msgid "&New..."
msgstr "&Yaña..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:59
msgid "Chan&ge..."
msgstr "&Üzgärtü..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:63
msgid "De&lete"
msgstr "&Beter"

#: domainlistview.cpp:67
msgid "&Import..."
msgstr "&İmport..."

#: domainlistview.cpp:73
msgid "&Export..."
msgstr "&Çığaru...."

#: domainlistview.cpp:82
msgid "Click on this button to manually add a host or domain specific policy."
msgstr "Xucağä yä domenğa xosusí säyäsät östär öçen bu töymägä bas."

#: domainlistview.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Click on this button to change the policy for the host or domain selected in "
"the list box."
msgstr ""
"Tartmadağı tezemnän saylanğan xuca yä ki domenğa qarata säyäsätne üzgärter öçen "
"bu töymägä bas."

#: domainlistview.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Click on this button to delete the policy for the host or domain selected in "
"the list box."
msgstr ""
"Tartmadağı tezemnän saylanğan xuca yä ki domenğa qarata säyäsätne taşlar öçen "
"bu töymägä bas."

#: domainlistview.cpp:133
msgid "You must first select a policy to be changed."
msgstr "Başta üzgärteläçäk säyäsätne saylarğa kiräk."

#: domainlistview.cpp:162
msgid "You must first select a policy to delete."
msgstr "Başta taşlanaçaq säyäsätne saylarğa kiräk."

#: domainlistview.cpp:200 policydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Use Global"
msgstr "Ğömümi köylämälärne qullan"

#: domainlistview.cpp:202 policydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Qabul"

#: domainlistview.cpp:204 policydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Reject"
msgstr "Çığart"

#: filteropts.cpp:52
msgid "Enable filters"
msgstr "Sözgeçlärne sälätländer"

#: filteropts.cpp:55
msgid "Hide filtered images"
msgstr "Sözelgän räsemnärne yäşer"

#: filteropts.cpp:58
msgid "URL Expressions to Filter"
msgstr "Sözeläçäk URL tezmäläre"

#: filteropts.cpp:63
msgid "Expression (e.g. http://www.site.com/ad/*):"
msgstr "Tezmä (mäs. http://www.saxifa.com/reklam/*):"

#: filteropts.cpp:71
msgid "Update"
msgstr "Yañart"

#: filteropts.cpp:76
#, fuzzy
msgid "Import..."
msgstr "&İmport..."

#: filteropts.cpp:78
#, fuzzy
msgid "Export..."
msgstr "&Çığaru...."

#: filteropts.cpp:88
msgid ""
"Enable or disable AdBlocK filters. When enabled a set of expressions to be "
"blocked should be defined in the filter list for blocking to take effect."
msgstr "AdBlocK sözgeçlärne sälätle/sälätsez it."

#: filteropts.cpp:91
msgid ""
"When enabled blocked images will be removed from the page completely otherwise "
"a placeholder 'blocked' image will be used."
msgstr ""
"Sälätländerelgändä, tuqtatqan räsemnär bittän tulısınça atılğan bulır, yuğisä, "
"'tuqıtatılğan' almaştıruçı räsem qullanılır."

#: filteropts.cpp:93
msgid ""
"This is the list of URL filters that will be applied to all linked images and "
"frames. The filters are processed in order so place more generic filters "
"towards the top of the list."
msgstr ""
"Bu - barlıq sıltalğan räsem häm qısalar öçen qullanılaçaq URL sözgeçläre "
"tezmäse. Sözgeçlär ber-ber artlı eşlilär, şuña kürä ğömümiräk sözgeçlärne "
"tezemneñ östenä quyası."

#: filteropts.cpp:96
msgid ""
"Enter an expression to filter. Expressions can be defined as either a filename "
"style wildcard e.g. http://www.site.com/ads* or as a full regular expression by "
"surrounding the string with '/' e.g.  //(ad|banner)\\./"
msgstr ""
"Sözgeçkä äytemne/tezmäne kert. Tezmälärdä alıştıruçı simvollar, mäs. "
"http://www.saxifa.com/reklam* qullanıla ala, '/' belän ayırılğan tulı regular "
"tezmä, mäs.:  //(ad|banner)\\ kertü dä mömkin./"

#: filteropts.cpp:324
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror AdBlocK</h1> Konqueror AdBlocK allows you to create a list of "
"filters that are checked against linked images and frames. URL's that match are "
"either discarded or replaced with a placeholder image. "
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror AdBlocK</h1> Konqueror AdBlocK sıltamalı räsem häm qısalarğa "
"qarşı eşlägän sözgeçlär tezmäsen yasarğa mömkinlek birä. Sözgeçkä eläkkän "
"URL'lar yä kürsätelmi, äy almaştıruçı räsem belän almaşına. "

#: htmlopts.cpp:41
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Browser</h1> Here you can configure Konqueror's browser "
"functionality. Please note that the file manager functionality has to be "
"configured using the \"File Manager\" configuration module. You can make some "
"settings how Konqueror should handle the HTML code in the web pages it loads. "
"It is usually not necessary to change anything here."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Gizgeçe</h1> Konqueror'nıñ gizgeç bularaq eşläwen bonda köyläp "
"bula. Bonı beläse: birem citäkçese bularaq eşläwe \"Birem Citäkçese\" digän "
"caylaw modulı aşa köylänä. HTML eçtälegen eşkärtü buyınça köyläwlärne üzgärtep "
"bulsa da, küp oçraqlarda anıñ kiräge çıqmí."

#: htmlopts.cpp:49
msgid "Boo&kmarks"
msgstr "Bitbil&ge"

#: htmlopts.cpp:50
msgid "Ask for name and folder when adding bookmarks"
msgstr "Bitbilge salğanda, isem häm törgäkne sora"

#: htmlopts.cpp:51
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will allow you to change the title of the "
"bookmark and choose a folder in which to store it when you add a new bookmark."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, yaña bitbilge salğanda, Konqueror siña anıñ başlığın üzgärtergä "
"häm ul saqlanaçaq törgäkne saylarğa röxsät itär."

#: htmlopts.cpp:55
msgid "Show only marked bookmarks in bookmark toolbar"
msgstr "Bitbilgelär qolğasında tamğalanğan bitbilgelärne genä kürsät"

#: htmlopts.cpp:56
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will show only those bookmarks in the "
"bookmark toolbar which you have marked to do so in the bookmark editor."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, Konqueror bitbilgelär qolğasında sin bitbilge tözätkeçendä "
"kürsätkän bitbilgelärne genä kürsäter."

#: htmlopts.cpp:65
msgid "Form Com&pletion"
msgstr "Forma &Tuldıru"

#: htmlopts.cpp:66
msgid "Enable completion of &forms"
msgstr "&Formalar tuldıruın sälätländer"

#: htmlopts.cpp:67
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will remember the data you enter in web forms "
"and suggest it in similar fields for all forms."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, Konqueror, sin web formalarğa kertkän mäğlümätne xäterdä qaldırıp, "
"başqa formalarnıñ oxşaş qırlarında täqdim itäçäk."

#: htmlopts.cpp:72
msgid "&Maximum completions:"
msgstr "&Maksimum tuldıru sanı:"

#: htmlopts.cpp:75
msgid ""
"Here you can select how many values Konqueror will remember for a form field."
msgstr ""
"Monda Konqueror'nıñ ber forma qırı öçen iñ küp niçä zurlıqnı xäterdä "
"qaldıraçağın saylarğa bula."

#: htmlopts.cpp:83
msgid "Tabbed Browsing"
msgstr "Tabaqlı Browser"

#: htmlopts.cpp:86
msgid "Open &links in new tab instead of in new window"
msgstr "Sı&ltamalarnı yaña täräzädä tügel, yaña tabaqta aç"

#: htmlopts.cpp:87
msgid ""
"This will open a new tab instead of a new window in various situations, such as "
"choosing a link or a folder with the middle mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Qayber oçraqlarda, mäsälän sıltama yä ki törgäkkä küseneñ urta ayağı belän "
"basqanda, bu yaña täräzä urnına yaña tabaq açar."

#: htmlopts.cpp:92
msgid "Hide the tab bar when only one tab is open"
msgstr "Ber genä tabaq açıq bulğanda tabaqlar qolğasın yäşer"

#: htmlopts.cpp:93
msgid ""
"This will display the tab bar only if there are two or more tabs. Otherwise it "
"will always be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Tabaqlar qolğası ike yä ki kübräk tabaq bulğanda ğına kürener, yuğisä "
"yäşerener."

#: htmlopts.cpp:108
msgid "Mouse Beha&vior"
msgstr "Küse &Qılanışı"

#: htmlopts.cpp:110
msgid "Chan&ge cursor over links"
msgstr "Sıltamalar östendä kürsätkeçne &alıştır"

#: htmlopts.cpp:111
msgid ""
"If this option is set, the shape of the cursor will change (usually to a hand) "
"if it is moved over a hyperlink."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, küse sıltama östenä taşılğanda kürsätkeç şäkele üzgärer (ğädättä "
"barmaq belän kürsätüçe qul)."

#: htmlopts.cpp:115
msgid "M&iddle click opens URL in selection"
msgstr "Küseneñ &urta ayağına basu saylanğan URLnı aça"

#: htmlopts.cpp:117
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can open the URL in the selection by middle "
"clicking on a Konqueror view."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, saylanuda bulğan URLnı Konqueror küreneşendä küseneñ urta ayağına "
"basıp açarğa mömkin bulır."

#: htmlopts.cpp:121
msgid "Right click goes &back in history"
msgstr "Uñ ayaqqa basıp uzğanğa qaytırğa &bula"

#: htmlopts.cpp:123
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, you can go back in history by right clicking on a "
"Konqueror view. To access the context menu, press the right mouse button and "
"move."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, Konqueror küreneşendä uñ ayaqqa basıp, uzğanğa kire qaytırğa bula. "
"Kontekst saylağı öçen uñ ayaqqa basıp xäräkät it."

#: htmlopts.cpp:132
msgid "A&utomatically load images"
msgstr "Räsemnär üzennän üzläre &yöklänsen."

#: htmlopts.cpp:133
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will automatically load any images that are "
"embedded in a web page. Otherwise, it will display placeholders for the images, "
"and you can then manually load the images by clicking on the image button."
"<br>Unless you have a very slow network connection, you will probably want to "
"check this box to enhance your browsing experience."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, Konqueror bittäge räsemnärne automatik räweştä yöklär. Yüğisä "
"räsemnär urnına almaştırğıç räsemnär (urın totuçılar) kürsäteler. Sin räsemnär "
"töymäsenä basıp räsemnärne yökli alasız."
"<br>Bik äkren çeltär totaşuıñ bulmasa ğına, bu tartmanı tamğalap päräwezdä "
"gizüeñne räxäträk yasí alasıñ."

#: htmlopts.cpp:138
msgid "Dra&w frame around not completely loaded images"
msgstr "Tulısınça yöklänmägän räsemnär tiräli qısa &sız"

#: htmlopts.cpp:139
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, Konqueror will draw a frame as placeholder around not "
"yet fully loaded images that are embedded in a web page."
"<br>Especially if you have a slow network connection, you will probably want to "
"check this box to enhance your browsing experience."
msgstr ""
"Bu saylansa, Konqueror bittä bulğan tulısınça yöklänmägän räsemnär tiräli urın "
"totuçı bularaq qısanı sızar."
"<br>Ayıruça bik äkren çeltär totaşuıñ bulsa, bu tartmanı tamğalap päräwezdä "
"gizüeñne räxäträk yasí alasıñ."

#: htmlopts.cpp:144
msgid "Allow automatic delayed &reloading/redirecting"
msgstr "Automatik kiçekte&relgän yañadan yökläw häm yünältüne röxsät it."

#: htmlopts.cpp:146
msgid ""
"Some web pages request an automatic reload or redirection after a certain "
"period of time. By unchecking this box Konqueror will ignore these requests."
msgstr ""
"Qayber bitlär bilgele ber aradan soñ üzennän üzläreneñ yañadan yöklänmäsen "
"täläp itälär. Bu tartma tamğalanmasa, Konqueror bu tör täläplärgä ähämiät "
"birmäs."

#: htmlopts.cpp:158
msgid "Und&erline links:"
msgstr "Sıltamalarnı &assız:"

#: htmlopts.cpp:161
msgid ""
"_: underline\n"
"Enabled"
msgstr "Bar"

#: htmlopts.cpp:162
msgid ""
"_: underline\n"
"Disabled"
msgstr "Yuq"

#: htmlopts.cpp:163
msgid "Only on Hover"
msgstr "Östenä kilgändä genä"

#: htmlopts.cpp:167
msgid ""
"Controls how Konqueror handles underlining hyperlinks:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Enabled</b>: Always underline links</li>"
"<li><b>Disabled</b>: Never underline links</li>"
"<li><b>Only on Hover</b>: Underline when the mouse is moved over the link</li>"
"</ul>"
"<br><i>Note: The site's CSS definitions can override this value</i>"
msgstr ""
"Konqueror'nıñ assızılğan sıltamalar belän niçek qılanaçağın bilgeli: "
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Açıq</b>:Härwaqıt sıltamalarnı assız</li>"
"<li><b>Sünek</b>:Berqayçanda sıltamalarnı assızma</li>"
"<li><b>Östen qaplağanda ğına</b>:Küse sıltamanıñ östenä kilgändä genä astın "
"sız.</li></ul>"
"<br><i>İskärmä: Säxifäneñ CSS üzençälekläre moña qaramí ala</i>"

#: htmlopts.cpp:178
msgid "A&nimations:"
msgstr "Ca&nlandıru:"

#: htmlopts.cpp:181
msgid ""
"_: animations\n"
"Enabled"
msgstr "Açıq"

#: htmlopts.cpp:182
msgid ""
"_: animations\n"
"Disabled"
msgstr "Sünek"

#: htmlopts.cpp:183
msgid "Show Only Once"
msgstr "Ber Tapqır Ğına Kürsät"

#: htmlopts.cpp:187
msgid ""
"Controls how Konqueror shows animated images:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Enabled</b>: Show all animations completely.</li>"
"<li><b>Disabled</b>: Never show animations, show the start image only.</li>"
"<li><b>Show only once</b>: Show all animations completely but do not repeat "
"them.</li>"
msgstr ""
"Konqueror'nıñ canlandırmalı räsemnärne niçek kürsätäçägen bilgeli:"
"<br>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Açıq</b>: Böten canlandırmalarnı tulısınça kürsät.</li>"
"<li><b>Sünek</b>: Canlandırmalarnı berqayçan da kürsätmä, başlanğıç räsemne "
"genä kürsät.</li>"
"<li><b>Ber märtäbä genä kürsät</b>: Böten canlandırmalarnı tulısınça kürsät, "
"läkin qabatlama.</li>"

#: javaopts.cpp:62 jsopts.cpp:48 pluginopts.cpp:59
msgid "Global Settings"
msgstr "Ğömümi Köylämälär"

#: javaopts.cpp:64
msgid "Enable Ja&va globally"
msgstr "Java'nı qullan"

#: javaopts.cpp:79
msgid "Java Runtime Settings"
msgstr "Java Eşlätü Köylämäläre"

#: javaopts.cpp:85
msgid "&Use security manager"
msgstr "Saqlıq citäkçesen q&ullan"

#: javaopts.cpp:89
msgid "Use &KIO"
msgstr "&KIO Qullanu"

#: javaopts.cpp:93
msgid "Shu&tdown applet server when inactive"
msgstr "Aktif bulmağanda apple&t serverın sünder"

#: javaopts.cpp:101
msgid "App&let server timeout:"
msgstr "Applet serverı kiçekmä aralığı:"

#: javaopts.cpp:102
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sek"

#: javaopts.cpp:107
msgid "&Path to Java executable, or 'java':"
msgstr "Java başqarğanğa ('java'ğa) &yul:"

#: javaopts.cpp:115
msgid "Additional Java a&rguments:"
msgstr "Östämä Java üzgärmä zurlıqları:"

#: javaopts.cpp:123
msgid ""
"Enables the execution of scripts written in Java that can be contained in HTML "
"pages. Note that, as with any browser, enabling active contents can be a "
"security problem."
msgstr ""
"HTML bitlärendä oçrí torğan Java'da yazılğan scriptlar başqarılmasın tä'min "
"itä."

#: javaopts.cpp:126
msgid ""
"This box contains the domains and hosts you have set a specific Java policy "
"for. This policy will be used instead of the default policy for enabling or "
"disabling Java applets on pages sent by these domains or hosts. "
"<p>Select a policy and use the controls on the right to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Bu tartmada xosusí Java säyäsätenä duçar itkän domen häm xucalar tora. Bu "
"säyäsät, östäge domen häm xucalardan kilgän appletlarnı sälätle/sälätsez itü "
"öçen bar bulğan säyäsät urnına qullanılır. "
"<p> Ber säyäsätne sayla da uñdağı idärälär qullanıp üzgärtülär yasa."

#: javaopts.cpp:133
msgid ""
"Click this button to choose the file that contains the Java policies. These "
"policies will be merged with the existing ones. Duplicate entries are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Java säyäsätläre bulğan biremne saylar öçen bu töymägä bas. Bu säyäsätlär bar "
"bulğan säyäsätlär belän berläştereler. Qabatlanğan kertemnär qaralmíça üteler."

#: javaopts.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Click this button to save the Java policy to a zipped file. The file, named <b>"
"java_policy.tgz</b>, will be saved to a location of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Java säyäsäten ziplanğan birem eçenä saqlar öçen bu töymägä bas. <b>"
"java_policy.tgz</b> isemle birem sin saylağan törgäktä saqlanaçaq."

#: javaopts.cpp:140
msgid ""
"Here you can set specific Java policies for any particular host or domain. To "
"add a new policy, simply click the <i>New...</i> button and supply the "
"necessary information requested by the dialog box. To change an existing "
"policy, click on the <i>Change...</i> button and choose the new policy from the "
"policy dialog box. Clicking on the <i>Delete</i> button will remove the "
"selected policy, causing the default policy setting to be used for that domain."
msgstr ""
"Monda bilgele xucalar häm domennar öçen xosusí Java säyäsätlären köylärgä bula. "
"Yaña säyäsät östär öçen, <i>Yaña...</i> töymäsenä basıp, kiräkle mäğlümätne "
"dialog tartmasına kert. Bulğan säyäsätne üzgärter öçen, <i>Üzgärt...</i> "
"töymäsenä basıp dialog tartmasınnan yaña säyäsät sayla. <i>Taşla</i> "
"töymäsenä basu saylanğan säyäsätneñ taşlanaçağına häm tege domen öçen bar "
"bulğan säyäsät qullanuına kiterer."

#: javaopts.cpp:153
msgid ""
"Enabling the security manager will cause the jvm to run with a Security Manager "
"in place. This will keep applets from being able to read and write to your file "
"system, creating arbitrary sockets, and other actions which could be used to "
"compromise your system. Disable this option at your own risk. You can modify "
"your $HOME/.java.policy file with the Java policytool utility to give code "
"downloaded from certain sites more permissions."
msgstr ""
"Saqlıq Citäkçesen sälätländerü jvmnı Saqlıq Citäkçese belän bergä eşläter. Ul "
"aplletlarnı fayllarıñnı uqu häm fayllarğa yazudan häm sistemıñnı boza alğan "
"başqa ğämällärdän totqarlar. Bu saylanmanı ber tapqır sälätsez qaldırır "
"aldınnan başta cide tapqır uyla. Ayırım räweştä $HOME/.java.policy faylın Java "
"policytool qoralın qullanıp üzgärtä häm qayber säxifälärgä küräk röxsät "
"bireläçäkne tä'min itä alasıñ."

#: javaopts.cpp:161
msgid "Enabling this will cause the jvm to use KIO for network transport "
msgstr ""
"Monı sälätländerü jvmnıñ çeltär taşımasında KIO'nıñ qullanaçağına kiterer. "

#: javaopts.cpp:163
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the java executable. If you want to use the jre in your path, "
"simply leave it as 'java'. If you need to use a different jre, enter the path "
"to the java executable (e.g. /usr/lib/jdk/bin/java), or the path to the "
"directory that contains 'bin/java' (e.g. /opt/IBMJava2-13)."
msgstr ""
"Java başqaruçısınıñ yulın kert. Yulda klassik JRE qullanırğa teläsäñ, monda "
"'java' ğına yaz. Başqa JRE qullanırğa teläsäñ, java başqaruçısına turı yulnı  "
"(mäs: /usr/lib/jdk/bin/java), yä ki bin/java yatqan törgäkneñ tulı yulın kert "
"(mäs: /opt/IBMJava2-13)."

#: javaopts.cpp:168
msgid ""
"If you want special arguments to be passed to the virtual machine, enter them "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Xíalí sanaqqa cibärergä telägän xosusí köylämä zurlıqlarıñ bulsa, alarnı monda "
"kert."

#: javaopts.cpp:170
msgid ""
"When all the applets have been destroyed, the applet server should shut down. "
"However, starting the jvm takes a lot of time. If you would like to keep the "
"java process running while you are browsing, you can set the timeout value to "
"whatever you like. To keep the java process running for the whole time that the "
"konqueror process is, leave the Shutdown Applet Server checkbox unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Barlıq appletlar yuq bulğanda applet serverı sünärgä tieş. Tik jvm'nı başlatu "
"küp waqıt ala. Ägär, internetta gizgändä, java prosesslarınıñ däwamlı eşlägänen "
"teläsäñ, kiçegü arasın telägänçä üzgärtä alasıñ. Konqueror prosessınıñ böten "
"waqıtı buyına java prosessın däwam eşlätergä teläsäñ, Applet Serverın Sünder "
"tartmasın tamğalamíça qaldır."

