#: jspolicies.cpp:148
msgid "Open new windows:"
msgstr "Yaña täräzälärne aç:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:157 jspolicies.cpp:212 jspolicies.cpp:250 jspolicies.cpp:288
#: jspolicies.cpp:329
msgid "Use global"
msgstr "Ğömümi räweştä qullan"

#: jspolicies.cpp:158 jspolicies.cpp:213 jspolicies.cpp:251 jspolicies.cpp:289
#: jspolicies.cpp:330
msgid "Use setting from global policy."
msgstr "Ğömümi säyäsättäge köylämälärne qullan."

#: jspolicies.cpp:164 jspolicies.cpp:219 jspolicies.cpp:257 jspolicies.cpp:295
#: jspolicies.cpp:336
msgid "Allow"
msgstr "Röxsät it"

#: jspolicies.cpp:165
msgid "Accept all popup window requests."
msgstr "Barlıq qalquçı täräzälär teläklären qabul it."

#: jspolicies.cpp:170
msgid "Ask"
msgstr "Sora"

#: jspolicies.cpp:171
msgid "Prompt every time a popup window is requested."
msgstr "Här qalquçı täräzädän raslaw sorat."

#: jspolicies.cpp:176
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Tıyu"

#: jspolicies.cpp:177
msgid "Reject all popup window requests."
msgstr "Böten qalquçı täräzälär teläklären kire qaq."

#: jspolicies.cpp:182
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "Aqıllı"

#: jspolicies.cpp:183
msgid ""
"Accept popup window requests only when links are activated through an explicit "
"mouse click or keyboard operation."
msgstr ""
"Küse yä ki töylekkä basudan açılğan qalquçı täräzälärneñ açıluın ğına röxsät "
"it."

#: jspolicies.cpp:190
msgid ""
"If you disable this, Konqueror will stop interpreting the <i>window.open()</i> "
"JavaScript command. This is useful if you regularly visit sites that make "
"extensive use of this command to pop up ad banners."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Note:</b> Disabling this option might also break certain sites that "
"require <i>window.open()</i> for proper operation. Use this feature carefully."
msgstr ""
"Monı sälätsez itsäñ, Konqueror <i>window.open()</i> JavaScript ämeren ütäwdän "
"tuqtayaçaq. Bu qayber säxifälärgä kergän waqıtta qarşığa qalıqqan reklam "
"täräzälären kürsätmäwdä faydalı bula ala. "
"<br>"
"<br><b> İskärmä:</b> Bu saylanmanı sälätsez qaldıru qaywaqıt normal maqsat "
"belän  <i>window.open()</i> ämeren qullanğan säxifälär kürsätelüen boza ala. "
"Şuña kürä bu mömkinlekne uylap qına qullanası."

#: jspolicies.cpp:204
msgid "Resize window:"
msgstr "Täräzäneñ zurlığın üzgärt:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:220
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window size."
msgstr "Täräzä zurlığın üzgärtkän skriptlarnı röxsät it."

#: jspolicies.cpp:225 jspolicies.cpp:263 jspolicies.cpp:301 jspolicies.cpp:342
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Uzası"

#: jspolicies.cpp:226
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window size. The web page will <i>"
"think</i> it changed the size but the actual window is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Skriptlarnıñ täräzä zurlığın üzgärtü totınuların ähämiätsez qaldır. Säxifä "
"täräzäneñ zurlığın <i>üzgärtkän</i> dip uylayaçaq, läkin täräzäneñ çın zurlığı "
"üzgärmäs."

#: jspolicies.cpp:233
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window size on their own by using <i>"
"window.resizeBy()</i> or <i>window.resizeTo()</i>. This option specifies the "
"treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Qayber säxifälär <i>window.resizeBy()</i> yä ki <i>window.resizeTo()</i> "
"qullanıp üzläre genä täräzä zurlığın üzgärtälär. Bu mömkinlek andí totınularğa "
"qarata qılanışnı bilgeli."

#: jspolicies.cpp:242
msgid "Move window:"
msgstr "Täräzäne taşı:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:258
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window position."
msgstr "Täräzä urının üzgärtkän skriptlarnı röxsät it."

#: jspolicies.cpp:264
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window position. The web page will <i>"
"think</i> it moved the window but the actual position is not affected."
msgstr ""
"Skriptlarnıñ täräzä urının üzgärtergä totınuların ähämiätsez qaldır. Säxifä "
"täräzäne taşığan dip <i>uylar</i>, läkin çın urını üzgärmäs."

#: jspolicies.cpp:271
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window position on their own by using <i>"
"window.moveBy()</i> or <i>window.moveTo()</i>. This option specifies the "
"treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Qayber säxifälär <i>window.moveBy()</i> yä ki <i>window.moveTo()</i> "
"qullanıp üzläre genä täräzäne urınınnan taşílar. Bu mömkinlek andí totınularğa "
"qarata qılanışnı bilgeli."

#: jspolicies.cpp:280
msgid "Focus window:"
msgstr "Täräzäne üzäklä:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:296
msgid "Allow scripts to focus the window."
msgstr "Täräzäne üzäkläwçe skriptlarnı röxsät it."

#: jspolicies.cpp:302
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to focus the window. The web page will <i>think</i> "
"it brought the focus to the window but the actual focus will remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Skriptlarnıñ täräzäne üzklärgä totınuların ähämiätsez qaldır. Säxifä täräzäne "
"üzäkkä salğan dip <i>uylar</i>, läkin çın üzäkläw üzgärmäs."

#: jspolicies.cpp:310
msgid ""
"Some websites set the focus to their browser window on their own by using <i>"
"window.focus()</i>. This usually leads to the window being moved to the front "
"interrupting whatever action the user was dedicated to at that time. This "
"option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Qayber säxifälär <i>window.focus()</i> qullanıp arqada qaldırılğan üz "
"täräzälären yañadan alğa kiterälär häm şulay itep qullanuçınıñ şul anda eşlägän "
"eşenä qomaçawlí. Bu mömkinlek andí totınularğa qarata qılanışnı bilgeli."

#: jspolicies.cpp:321
msgid "Modify status bar text:"
msgstr "Torım qolğasınıñ tekstın üzgärt:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:337
msgid "Allow scripts to change the text of the status bar."
msgstr "Torım qolğasındağı tekstnı üzgärtkän skriptlarnı röxsät itä."

#: jspolicies.cpp:343
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the status bar text. The web page will <i>"
"think</i> it changed the text but the actual text will remain unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Skriptlarnıñ torım qolğası tekstın üzgärtergä totınularına ähämiät birmä. "
"Säxifä bu tekstnı üzgärtkän dip <i>uylar</i>, läkin çınlıqta tekst üzgärmäs."

#: jspolicies.cpp:351
msgid ""
"Some websites change the status bar text by setting <i>window.status</i> or <i>"
"window.defaultStatus</i>, thus sometimes preventing displaying the real URLs of "
"hyperlinks. This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr ""
"Qayber säxifälär <i>window.status</i> yä ki <i>window.defaultStatus</i> "
"qullanıp torım qolğası tekstın üzgärtälär dä şulay itep sıltamalarnı çın "
"URL'larınıñ kürsätelüenä qomaçawlí. Bu mömkinlek andí totınularğa qarata "
"qılanışnı bilgeli."

