#: pluginopts.cpp:257
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Plugins</h1> The Konqueror web browser can use Netscape plugins "
"to show special content, just like the Navigator does. Please note that the way "
"you have to install Netscape plugins may depend on your distribution. A typical "
"place to install them is, for example, '/opt/netscape/plugins'."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror Qusılmaları</h1> Konqueror'nıñ web-gizgeçe qayber eştälek kürsätü "
"öçen Netscape quşılmaların qullana ala, Netscape üze kebek. Beläse: quşılma "
"quyu tärtibe taratma tözeleşenä bäyle bula ala. Alarnıñ quyılu urını yışraq "
"'/opt/netscape/plugins' törgägendä bula."

